    "detailed_description": "Geometric characters join a chaotic rumble of battling and racing!<br />\r\nExperience exhilarating gameplay with simple controls!<br />\r\nUp to six players can enter the fray!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBattle<br />\r\nFight your way through an array of stages featuring their own mechanics and an arsenal of unique weapons!<br />\r\nAchieve victory with split-second decisions and tactics!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRace<br />\r\nThere's one more trial on the road to proving your might!<br />\r\nUse every tool at your disposal to reach the goal before anyone else!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCreate<br />\r\nMake original stages for both battling and racing!<br />\r\nCombine traps, obstacles, and weapons in endless combinations!<br />\r\nOnce your stage is ready, put it to the test with a battle of epic proportions!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Controllers are required for multiplayer play.",
